  <trk>
    <name>Helgonleden, The Saints Trail, Kårböle till Huskölen</name>
    <desc>From Kårböle, Helgonleden follows the trail of Kårböle north, along the north-eastern beach of Ljusnan, up to the old school of Huskölen, where you can book your accommodation.</desc>
